# Env

Copy to `.env` locally. On Railway, set the same variables on the service.

Do **not** place real PSTN calls from this repo's tests. Tests mock Telnyx and xAI.

## Required for outbound calls

| Variable | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `TELNYX_API_KEY` | Telnyx Call Control API (Bearer). |
| `TELNYX_CONNECTION_ID` | Call Control Application ID. Ops: `3041732714274227469`. |
| `FROM_NUMBER` | Caller ID. Default / production: `+351210210260`. |
| `XAI_API_KEY` | xAI Grok Voice Live 2 (`wss://api.x.ai/v1/realtime`). |
| `API_KEY` | Bearer token for `POST /api/outbound` and `GET /api/calls/:id`. |
| `PUBLIC_BASE_URL` | Public HTTPS origin of this service (Railway URL). Used for Telnyx webhooks and the media WebSocket (`wss://…/media-stream`). |

## Voice / model

| Variable | Default | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `GROK_VOICE` | `ara` | Grok Voice Live 2 voice. |
| `GROK_MODEL` | `grok-voice-think-fast-2.0` | Grok Voice Live 2 model (`grok-voice-latest` aliases the same family). |

## Optional

| Variable | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `RESULT_WEBHOOK` | `POST` JSON when a call ends (transcript + status). Empty disables. |
| `TELNYX_PUBLIC_KEY` | Account Ed25519 public key (Mission Control). When set, `/webhooks/telnyx` verifies `telnyx-signature-ed25519`. |
| `XAI_BASE_URL` | Default `https://api.x.ai`. |
| `TELNYX_API_BASE` | Default `https://api.telnyx.com`. |
| `PORT` | HTTP port. Railway injects this. Default `3000`. |
| `MAX_CALL_SECONDS` | Hard cap before hangup. Default `600`. |

This service is **outbound-only** and is **not** Alice (no inbound SIP, no Alfaseguros inbound prompt).
